{"id":"cb03dde3272f1f46","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyTypeProof.md","title":"PolyTypeProof","display":"PolyTypeProof","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"PolyTypeProof","parameters":["d","g","t","a","z1882"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"PolyTypeProof"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>d</span><span>g</span><span>t</span><span>a</span><span>z1882</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：System F 类型判断与独立算法。有序参数：<code>d</code>、<code>g</code>、<code>t</code>、<code>a</code>、<code>z1882</code>。</p>\n<p>五条独立声明规则；类型抽象前提必须提升全部上下文类型。：非空有限见证列。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ PolyTypeProof d g t a z1882)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists z1885\n  (exists z1886\n    (and\n      (@ Seq z1882 z1885)\n      (and\n        (@ Last z1882 z1886)\n        (and\n          (exists z1920\n            (and (exists z1921 (and (@ Pair t a z1921) (@ Pair g z1921 z1920))) (@ Pair d z1920 z1886)))\n          (forall z1883\n            (implies\n              (in z1883 z1885)\n              (exists z1884 (and (@ App z1882 z1883 z1884) (@ PolyTypeRow z1882 z1883 z1884))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d72dedf3d7200b4b\" href=\"?note=d72dedf3d7200b4b\" title=\"ZFC_Last\">Last</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0a7fe33bb2e95221\" href=\"?note=0a7fe33bb2e95221\" title=\"ZFC_Pair\">Pair</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"527757ee57dab948\" href=\"?note=527757ee57dab948\" title=\"ZFC_PolyTypeRow\">PolyTypeRow</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" href=\"?note=ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" title=\"ZFC_Seq\">Seq</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ PolyTypeProof d g t a z1882)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Last|Last]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_PolyTypeRow|PolyTypeRow]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Last","status":"resolved","id":"d72dedf3d7200b4b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Last|Last]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_PolyTypeRow|PolyTypeRow]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Pair","status":"resolved","id":"0a7fe33bb2e95221","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Last|Last]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_PolyTypeRow|PolyTypeRow]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_PolyTypeRow","status":"resolved","id":"527757ee57dab948","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Last|Last]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_PolyTypeRow|PolyTypeRow]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Seq","status":"resolved","id":"ae1f2bbcc1dff983","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Last|Last]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_PolyTypeRow|PolyTypeRow]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":1339,"backlinks":[{"id":"de2d60bf72fd6cc5","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_PolyTypeProof|PolyTypeProof]]"},{"id":"123c0b237d7b0c5a","anchor":"ref-545","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZFC_PolyTypeProof|PolyTypeProof]]"},{"id":"feb5357ce56a8ac2","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyTypeProof|PolyTypeProof]]"}],"outgoing":["f625c6fc1945e22e","8bd25e131370b9c4","d72dedf3d7200b4b","0a7fe33bb2e95221","527757ee57dab948","ae1f2bbcc1dff983","593f9bdab4d60707"]}